WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:02.827
Lesson eight. Clothes!

2
00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:10.780
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:13.650
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:16.707
Today we learn: Clothes! Let's go!

5
00:00:18.028 --> 00:00:21.361
Hat! Say it with me. Hat!

6
00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:28.508
Shirt! Say it with me. Shirt!

7
00:00:32.582 --> 00:00:36.298
Pants! Say it with me. Pants!

8
00:00:40.213 --> 00:00:43.647
Shoes! Say it with me. Shoes!

9
00:00:47.647 --> 00:00:51.213
Socks! Say it with me. Socks!

10
00:00:55.214 --> 00:00:58.630
Jacket! Say it with me. Jacket!

11
00:01:02.642 --> 00:01:05.825
Skirt! Say it with me. Skirt!

12
00:01:09.859 --> 00:01:13.359
Gloves! Say it with me. Gloves!

13
00:01:17.388 --> 00:01:22.555
Listen. I am wearing a hat and shoes.

14
00:01:22.605 --> 00:01:26.403
Say it with me. I am wearing a hat and shoes.

15
00:01:31.461 --> 00:01:36.692
Put on your red hat when you go out in the sun. Wear a jacket when it is cold.

16
00:01:36.742 --> 00:01:38.054
I like this story!

17
00:01:39.122 --> 00:01:43.703
What are these?

18
00:01:43.753 --> 00:01:45.273
They're pants!

19
00:01:46.154 --> 00:01:50.323
What's this?

20
00:01:50.373 --> 00:01:51.628
It's a jacket!

21
00:01:52.556 --> 00:02:01.823
This is O. O is for octopus. O is for orange. This is P. P is for pig. P is for pen.

22
00:02:05.837 --> 00:02:12.810
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

23
00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:14.533
Bye-bye, friends!

